      "side": 1,
      "message": "This dispatcher is only needed because `DepIsInSameApex` is called from `WalkDeps`, where `from` may not be `ctx.Module()`.  What do you think if instead we make `DepIsInSameApex` only take a `ctx` and `to` as arguments, call it from `GenerateAndroidBuildActions` on each direct dep, and store a list of the dependencies that are in the same apex in a provider.  Then the `WalkDeps` use case can query the provider on `parent` to see if `child` is listed in it to decide if the child is in the same apex.",
      "revId": "f6affd71ab8ad2d7858d8079078480c3d457422c",
