      "side": 1,
      "message": "One issue is that there potentially be a lot of data to cache, and they are only used in a few verification methods in apex, could those verifications be done differently? On this topic, I have notices that the gob cache had grown to about 116M with just two module types supported so far, this was even before I added all the new providers recently. I feel we probably have to revisit the cache stuff at some point. I will take another look when I am back.",
